        "title": "Nanoscale Physics: Quantum Confinement, Surface-to-Volume, van der Waals",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Below ~100 nm, three physical regimes shift simultaneously. Classical mechanics yields to\nquantum mechanics for electrons. Bulk thermodynamics yields to surface thermodynamics for\natoms. Gravity and viscous drag yield to van der Waals forces for particles."
    },
